noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

).
 Again,
 the preference has no effect on the likelihood to show no result of the type system (
\begin_inset Formula $\chi²$
\end_inset

(1,
 N = 18) = .80,
 p = .784).
 Additionally,
 there are (still) 11 participants who showed an interaction effect,
 i.e.,
 7 of the remaining participants did not show an interaction effect type system (t) * number of parameters (p) (
\begin_inset Formula $\frac{7}{18}=39\%$
\end_inset

).
